    <values><field>CheckDescription__c</field><value
      xsi:type="xsd:string"
    >Index 1 of a query ordered by a non-unique field. Contacts sharing a surname can come back in either order, so the row addressed is not repeatable. Deliberately misconfigured and deployed anyway, so the refusal is proven.</value></values>
